# Cryoshatter: "Enchant creature. Enchanted creature gets -5/-0. When enchanted creature becomes tapped or is dealt damage, destroy it."
# Bot1 puts it on its own Ornithopter (0/2 flying, so -5/-0 makes its power -5; its toughness is unchanged). On turn 3 the Ornithopter
# attacks: attacking taps it, the trigger destroys it. Bot2's Island-only deck has nothing to block with.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Cryoshatter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cryoshatter.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -5
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Cryoshatter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Life = 20
